    {
      "id": "KVaEbeNBmHg_vd_3Ker-D",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2220.8008993933227,
      "y": -1994.5894458120795,
      "width": 799.1995239257812,
      "height": 700,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "as",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1265855986,
      "version": 760,
      "versionNonce": 1327596914,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784284105350,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- short url generation should be \n    - fast \n    - unique\n    - short (5-7)\n\n1. prefix of the long url\n\n2. random number generator 10^9 10 characters \n    - base62 encoding, 0-9, A-Z, a-z\n    - 62^6 = 56B\n    - Birthday Paradox - 2 people in a group of 23 people have the same birthday\n    - 880k collisions \n    - we just need to check for collisions first \n\n3. Hash the long url \n    - md5(longUrl) -> hash -> base62(hash) [:6] \n    - same as above\n\n4. Counter\n    - incrementing a counter -> base62\n    - predicatbility which is bad for security\n        - \"warning, don't shorten private urls\"\n        - rate limiting\n    - bijective function \n        library :- \n        - squids.org\n   \n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- short url generation should be \n    - fast \n    - unique\n    - short (5-7)\n\n1. prefix of the long url\n\n2. random number generator 10^9 10 characters \n    - base62 encoding, 0-9, A-Z, a-z\n    - 62^6 = 56B\n    - Birthday Paradox - 2 people in a group of 23 people have the same birthday\n    - 880k collisions \n    - we just need to check for collisions first \n\n3. Hash the long url \n    - md5(longUrl) -> hash -> base62(hash) [:6] \n    - same as above\n\n4. Counter\n    - incrementing a counter -> base62\n    - predicatbility which is bad for security\n        - \"warning, don't shorten private urls\"\n        - rate limiting\n    - bijective function \n        library :- \n        - squids.org\n   \n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
