      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784281109787,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "HLD\n\nClient\n\nPrimary Server\n- creates short url\n- lookup long from short\n\nDatabase\n\ngetShortUrl(long)\nredirect(short)\n\n- 302 redirect - temporary (opted)\n- 301 redirect - permanent\n\nCounter\n\nRedis\n\n- read through\n- LRU cache\n\nkey : shortCode \nvalue : longUrl",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "HLD\n\nClient\n\nPrimary Server\n- creates short url\n- lookup long from short\n\nDatabase\n\ngetShortUrl(long)\nredirect(short)\n\n- 302 redirect - temporary (opted)\n- 301 redirect - permanent\n\nCounter\n\nRedis\n\n- read through\n- LRU cache\n\nkey : shortCode \nvalue : longUrl",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
